<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SantehLux — сантехника и инженерные материалы</title>
<meta name="description" content="SantehLux — заказ сантехники и материалов для монтажа: трубы, фитинги, арматура, котельное оборудование. Более 14 000 позиций: STOUT, ROMMER, Cimberio, Baxi, Рехау и другие бренды.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' rx='24' fill='%231466d9'/%3E%3Ctext x='50' y='70' font-size='54' text-anchor='middle' fill='white' font-family='Arial' font-weight='bold'%3ES%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#0c2440; --navy2:#123a63; --blue:#1466d9; --blue-d:#0d4cad;
  --acc:#ff8a1e; --acc-d:#e9740a;
  --bg:#f2f5f9; --card:#fff; --line:#e3eaf2; --tx:#1c2b3a; --mut:#64798f;
  --r:14px; --shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(16,42,67,.08);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:'Manrope',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);font-size:15px;line-height:1.45}
.wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button{font-family:inherit}
img{max-width:100%}

/* ---------- topbar ---------- */
.topbar{background:var(--navy);color:#cfe0f2;font-size:13px}
.topbar .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tb-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.tb-wa{color:#7fe3a1;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.tb-wa:hover{color:#a5f0be}

/* ---------- header ---------- */
.head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:66px}
.logo{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center;flex:none}
.logo-mark{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),#0aa2c0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(20,102,217,.35)}
.logo-mark svg{width:24px;height:24px}
.logo-text{font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2px;color:var(--navy);line-height:1}
.logo-text b{color:var(--blue)}
.logo-text small{display:block;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--mut);letter-spacing:.6px;margin-top:4px;text-transform:uppercase}
.search{flex:1;max-width:560px;position:relative}
.search svg{position:absolute;left:14px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:18px;height:18px;color:var(--mut);pointer-events:none}
.search input{width:100%;height:46px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px 0 42px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;outline:none;transition:.2s}
.search input:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(20,102,217,.12)}
.cartbtn{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:var(--acc);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:12px;height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;cursor:pointer;flex:none;transition:.2s;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(255,138,30,.35)}
.cartbtn:hover{background:var(--acc-d);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.badge{background:#fff;color:var(--acc-d);border-radius:20px;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:0 6px}

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0c2440 0%,#123a63 55%,#1466d9 135%);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(620px 320px at 85% 15%,rgba(255,138,30,.20),transparent 60%),
             radial-gradient(520px 280px at 8% 95%,rgba(10,162,192,.28),transparent 60%);}
.hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-60px;top:-40px;width:420px;height:420px;border:2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.10);border-radius:50%}
.hero-in{position:relative;padding:64px 20px 58px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.hero .eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:30px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:18px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(28px,4.6vw,46px);line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:800;max-width:760px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ffb469}
.hero p{font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,18px);color:#d7e4f4;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 28px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;height:52px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
.btn-acc{background:var(--acc);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(255,138,30,.4)}
.btn-acc:hover{background:var(--acc-d);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stats{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:36px}
.stat{background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-radius:12px;padding:13px 22px}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:21px}
.stat span{font-size:12.5px;color:#c9d9ec}

/* ---------- steps ---------- */
.steps{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.steps-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;padding:28px 20px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
.step-n{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),#0aa2c0);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(20,102,217,.3)}
.step b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:15px;color:var(--navy)}
.step p{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mut)}

/* ---------- sections ---------- */
.sec{padding:42px 20px 8px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.sec-title{font-size:25px;margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800}

/* ---------- category tiles ---------- */
.catgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(242px,1fr));gap:14px}
.cat-tile{position:relative;border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px;cursor:pointer;color:#fff;min-height:108px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:5px;transition:.2s;overflow:hidden;border:none;text-align:left}
.cat-tile:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(12,36,64,.28)}
.cat-tile svg{width:32px;height:32px;position:absolute;top:14px;right:16px;opacity:.9}
.cat-tile b{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800}
.cat-tile span{font-size:12px;opacity:.85;font-weight:600}

/* ---------- brands ---------- */
.brandrow{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.bchip{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 17px;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--navy2);cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.bchip:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}
.bchip.active{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}

/* ---------- catalog ---------- */
.catalog{padding-bottom:56px}
.cat-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:26px 0 12px}
.cat-line h2{font-size:21px;margin:0;color:var(--navy)}
.sortsel{border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy2);background:#fff;outline:none;cursor:pointer}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:4px;scrollbar-width:none}
.chips::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.chip{flex:none;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy2);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:.15s}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}
.chip.active{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.counter{color:var(--mut);font-size:13.5px;margin:10px 0 14px;font-weight:600}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(226px,1fr));gap:16px}
.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;border:1px solid transparent}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(12,36,64,.15);border-color:#dfe8f2}
.ph{height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4fb,#f8fbfe);position:relative;flex:none}
.ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;padding:10px}
.ph .ph-ic{width:62px;height:62px;color:var(--blue);display:inline-flex}
.ph .ph-ic svg{width:100%;height:100%}
.cbody{padding:12px 14px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;flex:1}
.cbrand{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue)}
.cname{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.35;min-height:37px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.csize{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.cfoot{margin-top:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.cprice{font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--navy)}
.addbtn{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 14px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;white-space:nowrap}
.addbtn:hover{background:var(--blue)}
.stepper{display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--navy);border-radius:9px;color:#fff;overflow:hidden;flex:none}
.stepper button{width:30px;height:36px;background:none;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:17px;cursor:pointer}
.stepper button:hover{color:#ffb469}
.stepper span{font-weight:800;min-width:24px;text-align:center;font-size:14px}
.more{display:block;margin:24px auto;padding:13px 36px;border:1.5px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);background:#fff;border-radius:12px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.more:hover{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.empty{display:none;color:#8aa;text-align:center;padding:46px 0;font-size:15px}

/* ---------- footer ---------- */
footer{background:var(--navy);color:#cfe0f2;margin-top:60px}
.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:30px;padding:40px 20px 30px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.fbrand{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
.fbrand b{color:var(--acc)}
footer p{font-size:13.5px;color:#9db4cd;margin:10px 0 0;max-width:340px}
footer h4{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#fff}
footer a.fl{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:9px;color:#cfe0f2}
footer a.fl:hover{color:#fff}
.fwa{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#25d366;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}
.fbot{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding:14px 20px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:#7f96af}

/* ---------- cart drawer ---------- */
.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,36,64,.5);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.25s;z-index:60}
.overlay.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.panel{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;height:100%;width:min(430px,100%);background:#fff;z-index:70;transform:translateX(105%);transition:.28s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:-8px 0 40px rgba(12,36,64,.25)}
.panel.show{transform:none}
.phead{padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.phead b{font-size:18px;color:var(--navy)}
.xbtn{background:#f1f5fa;border:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;font-size:17px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--navy2)}
.pbody{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:6px 20px}
.citem{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f4f9}
.cthumb{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4fb,#f8fbfe);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;overflow:hidden}
.cthumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}
.cthumb svg{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--blue)}
.citem .n{flex:1}
.citem .nm{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--tx)}
.citem .pp{font-size:12px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:3px}
.qty{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;flex:none}
.qty button{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:7px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);cursor:pointer;background:#fff;font-size:15px;color:var(--navy2)}
.qty b{min-width:24px;text-align:center;font-size:14px}
.del{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;opacity:.55;padding:4px}
.del:hover{opacity:1}
.pfoot{padding:16px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfcfe}
.orderform input{width:100%;padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:8px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;outline:none;transition:.15s}
.orderform input:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
small.hint{color:var(--mut);display:block;margin:2px 0 10px;font-size:12px}
.btn2{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;width:100%;padding:14px;border:none;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:9px;transition:.15s}
.btn2:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-wa{background:#25d366;color:#fff}
.btn-tg{background:#2aabee;color:#fff}
.btn-copy{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.empty-cart{color:var(--mut);text-align:center;padding:60px 10px;font-size:15px}
.empty-cart svg{width:54px;height:54px;color:#c3d2e2;margin-bottom:12px}

/* ---------- product modal ---------- */
.modal-ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,36,64,.55);z-index:80;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.modal-ov.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.pmodal{position:relative;background:#fff;border-radius:18px;max-width:560px;width:100%;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;transform:scale(.96);transition:.2s}
.modal-ov.show .pmodal{transform:scale(1)}
.pm-in{padding:22px}
.pm-ph{height:260px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4fb,#f8fbfe);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;overflow:hidden}
.pm-ph img{max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain}
.pm-ph svg{width:90px;height:90px;color:var(--blue)}
.pm-close{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:none;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.18);z-index:2}
.pm-brand{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}
.pm-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:10px}
.pm-rows{display:grid;gap:7px;margin:14px 0}
.pm-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;font-size:13.5px;padding:9px 13px;background:#f6f9fc;border-radius:9px}
.pm-row span{color:var(--mut)}
.pm-row b{text-align:right}
.pm-price{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);margin:14px 0}
.pm-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.pm-actions .addbtn{flex:1;padding:14px;font-size:15px;border-radius:12px}
.pm-actions .stepper button{height:44px}

/* ---------- fab ---------- */
.fab{display:none;position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:16px;z-index:55;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acc);border:none;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(255,138,30,.5);align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.fab svg{width:26px;height:26px}
.fab .badge{position:absolute;top:-4px;right:-4px}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .steps-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}
}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .logo-text small{display:none}
  .logo-text{font-size:18px}
  .hrow{gap:10px;height:60px}
  .cartbtn span.lbl{display:none}
  .topbar .tb-left{display:none}
  .hero-in{padding:44px 20px 44px}
  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(168px,1fr));gap:12px}
  .ph{height:120px}
  .fab{display:flex}
  .citem .del{display:none}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .hrow{flex-wrap:wrap;height:auto;padding:10px 0}
  .search{order:3;flex:1 1 100%;max-width:none}
  .cartbtn{margin-left:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tb-left">
      <span>Сантехника и инженерное оборудование</span>
      <span>·</span>
      <span>Соберём заказ и привезём на объект</span>
    </div>
    <a class="tb-wa" href="https://wa.me/79118974410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2zm5.4 14.1c-.2.6-1.2 1.2-1.7 1.2-.4.1-1 .1-1.6-.1-.4-.1-.9-.3-1.5-.6-2.6-1.1-4.3-3.8-4.4-4-.1-.2-1.1-1.4-1.1-2.7s.7-1.9.9-2.2c.2-.2.5-.3.7-.3h.5c.2 0 .4 0 .6.5l.8 2c.1.2.1.4 0 .6l-.4.6-.4.4c-.1.1-.3.3-.1.6.2.3.8 1.3 1.7 2.1 1.2 1 2.1 1.3 2.4 1.5.3.1.5.1.7-.1l1-1.1c.2-.3.4-.2.7-.1l1.9.9c.3.2.5.2.6.4 0 .2 0 .7-.2 1z"/></svg>
      +7 911 897-44-10
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<header class="head">
  <div class="wrap hrow">
    <a class="logo" href="#" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});return false;">
      <span class="logo-mark">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-6.4 5.6L3 17.2V21h3.8l5.3-5.3a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 5.6-6.4l-2.8 2.8-2.4-.7-.7-2.4 2.9-2.7z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="logo-text">Santeh<b>Lux</b><small>сантехника · арматура · материалы</small></span>
    </a>
    <div class="search">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
      <input id="q" placeholder="Поиск: кран, труба, радиатор, коллектор..." autocomplete="off">
    </div>
    <button class="cartbtn" id="cartBtn">
      <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1.6"/><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1.6"/><path d="M2 3h3l2.6 12.4a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.7a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L22 7H6"/></svg>
      <span class="lbl">Корзина</span>
      <span class="badge" id="cartCount">0</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-in">
    <span class="eyebrow">ЗАКАЗ МАТЕРИАЛОВ ДЛЯ МОНТАЖА</span>
    <h1>Всё для инженерных систем — <em>от крана до котла</em></h1>
    <p>Более 14 000 позиций для отопления и водоснабжения: STOUT, ROMMER, Cimberio, Baxi, Рехау и другие бренды. Выберите материалы — мы соберём заказ и привезём.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
